SUMMARY:Logic and Philosophy of Science Group (Jennifer Jhun\, Duke)
DESCRIPTION:The Logic and Philosophy of Science Research Group is pleased to welcome as its guest speaker Jennifer Jhun\, assistant professor of philosophy at Duke University as well as a Faculty Fellow at the Center for the History of Political Economy. She works mainly in the history and philosophy of science\, especially economics\, but have many auxiliary interests in epistemology\, social and political philosophy\, and applied ethics. \nTalk Title\nTBA \nTalk Abstract\nTBA
