SUMMARY:History of Philosophy Research Group (Sanford Shieh\, Wesleyan)
DESCRIPTION:The History of Modern Philosophy Group is pleased to welcome as its guest speaker Sanford Shieh\, the William Griffin Professor of Philosophy at Wesleyan University.  He is currently completing a book on modality in the main figures of early analytic philosophy: Frege\, Russell\, C I Lewis\, and Wittgenstein. \nTitle\nModality in Wittgenstein’s Tractatus and its aftermath \nAbstract\nTBA
